{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>在會議、飯局或交流活動中一次認識幾個人，名字往往在介紹過後轉眼就記不起；愈少開口稱呼對方，就愈難記住。NameSpark 是一款著重私隱的名字記憶工具，讓你為每次見面加入情境提示，需要時才短暫顯示名字，適合經常出席商務會議、客戶飯局、研討會及聯誼活動的人士。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>以情境線索記住對方名字</h2>\n<p>NameSpark 讓你可為每位新認識的人記下名字與提示線索，例如身處位置、所屬機構、職位或交談內容，之後需要時即可迅速找回正確名字，不必翻查冗長的通訊錄。它支援會議與晚宴的固定座位版面，也適用於站立走動的自由場合；名字預設隱藏，按住位置才會短暫顯示，資料只儲存在本機。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-186-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-187-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-188-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-189-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-190-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-191-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：NameSpark: Never Forget Names</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-11T01:04:49.914688+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":364,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}